# Next.js (apps/web)

## Architecture

- Default **Server Components** in `app/` routes
- `"use client"` only for: Framer Motion, forms, scroll listeners, browser APIs
- Reuse `WaitlistForm`, `Section`, `lib/animations.ts`, Tailwind tokens

## Data & API

```typescript
// ✅ Route handler — validate, delegate to @cashlight/db
export async function POST(req: Request) {
  const body = await req.json();
  // validate email
  const result = await addToWaitlist(email, source);
  return NextResponse.json({ success: true, position: result.position });
}
```

## Fonts & styles

- Display: `font-display` (Instrument Serif)
- Body: `font-body` (DM Sans)
- Use `@layer` utilities from `globals.css` (`.section-label`, `.card-surface`, `.btn-primary`)

## Landing page

Implement per `docs/Prompt_1_Landing_page.md`. Prefer single `page.tsx`; extract sections to `components/marketing/` only when file exceeds ~400 lines.
